gar/data/1806837/000110465925105239/0001104659-25-105239-index.htm"},{"date":"2025-10-21","form":"8-K","codes":["2.02","5.02","9.01"],"events":[{"label":"Results announced","kind":"results","tone":"blue"},{"label":"Director or officer departure or appointment","kind":"people","tone":"warn"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1806837/000110465925101040/0001104659-25-101040-index.htm"},{"date":"2025-08-06","form":"8-K","codes":["2.02","9.01"],"events":[{"label":"Results announced","kind":"results","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1806837/000155837025010402/0001558370-25-010402-index.htm"},{"date":"2025-06-17","form":"8-K","codes":["5.07"],"events":[{"label":"Shareholder vote results","kind":"governance","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1806837/000110465925060272/0001104659-25-060272-index.htm"},{"date":"2025-05-07","form":"8-K","codes":["2.02","9.01"],"events":[{"label":"Results announced","kind":"results","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1806837/000155837025006607/0001558370-25-006607-index.htm"}],"legal_events":[],"summary":{"sentences":["Vertex, Inc. files with the SEC under \"Services-Prepackaged Software\", based in PA, and has been publicly reporting for 5 years.","It reported $750.4m of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 11.1% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 63.5%.","Listed on Nasdaq, it funds itself from operations ($80.8m of operating cash flow over the year)."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Revenue grew 11.1% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025), reaching $196.6m in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1806837/000110465926057207/0001104659-26-057207-index.htm","accession":"0001104659-26-057207"},{"text":"Growth has been positive in all 8 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1806837/000110465926057207/0001104659-26-057207-index.htm","accession":"0001104659-26-057207"},{"text":"Gross margin of 63.5% means most of each additional sale falls through to cover fixed costs.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1806837/000110465926057207/0001104659-26-057207-index.htm","accession":"0001104659-26-057207"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $80.8m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1806837/000110465926057207/0001104659-26-057207-index.htm","accession":"0001104659-26-057207"}],"bear":[{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-5.4% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1806837/000110465926057207/0001104659-26-057207-index.htm","accession":"0001104659-26-057207"},{"text":"The operating loss widened by $15.1m against the same quarter a year earlier - it is getting worse, not better.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1806837/000110465926057207/0001104659-26-057207-index.htm","accession":"0001104659-26-057207"},{"text":"Debt of $340.5m against equity of $246.5m. Leverage decides who controls the outcome if trading deteriorates, and it is not the shareholder.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1806837/000110465926057207/0001104659-26-057207-index.htm","accession":"0001104659-26-057207"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin fall